OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a cold frosty start it
OL,6,Fwill be a dry morning with bright
OL,7,Fspells. Dry and cloudy for most in the
OL,8,Fafternoon but rain will arrive into
OL,9,Fthe west of Argyll later. Winds
OL,10,Fstrengthening in the west with coastal
OL,11,Fgales.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FHeavy rain and hill snow will
OL,14,Fspread eastwards through the evening
OL,15,Fand overnight, possibly becoming dry
OL,16,Fover western Argyll by morning. Breezy
OL,17,Fwith coastal gales at first, winds
OL,18,Feasing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
