OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRain will clear to the east
OL,6,Fthrough the morning, with some heavy
OL,7,Fdownpours as it does so. Becoming dry
OL,8,Fin the afternoon with some bright or
OL,9,Fsunny spells developing.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,12,Fspells and a few showers possible on
OL,13,FSaturday. Heavy showers spreading east
OL,14,FSunday. Further rain and strong winds
OL,15,Farriving from the west on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
